      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790553600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Recap",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Recap",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text-0329",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 474,
      "y": 1983.5,
      "width": 435.6,
      "height": 135.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp-0326"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b45",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1977382606,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1903511059,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790553600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• One pass = remove the lowest 1 bit with\n   integer = integer & (integer - 1).\n• count counts the passes, so it ends up equal\n   to the number of 1 bits.\n• The loop stops as soon as integer is 0.\n• 0 … 255 need 0 to 8 passes; any uint32_t 0 to 32.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• One pass = remove the lowest 1 bit with\n   integer = integer & (integer - 1).\n• count counts the passes, so it ends up equal\n   to the number of 1 bits.\n• The loop stops as soon as integer is 0.\n• 0 … 255 need 0 to 8 passes; any uint32_t 0 to 32.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rect-0331",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 1925.5,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 690.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp-0330"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b46",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1581715184,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1319986598,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790553600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "text-0332",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1344,
      "y": 1943.5,
      "width": 557.28,
      "height": 30.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp-0330"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b47",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 50961247,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 452217248,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790553600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What the loop prints: countBits(n) for n = 0 … 255",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What the loop prints: countBits(n) for n = 0 … 255",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text-0333",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1344,
      "y": 1981.5,
      "width": 469.12,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp-0330"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b48",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1213817966,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1850009568,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790553600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Row + column = n, e.g. 0x30 + 5 = 0x35 = 53, which has 4 ones.\nDarker yellow = more 1-bits. With this method every value is\nalso how many times the while loop ran for that number.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Row + column = n, e.g. 0x30 + 5 = 0x35 = 53, which has 4 ones.\nDarker yellow = more 1-bits. With this method every value is\nalso how many times the while loop ran for that number.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
